&lt;p&gt;Metal Mechanism: Notwithstanding the approved plans and supporting documents, the historic metal 
mechanism for opening the rooflight to the conservatory shall be retained and an 
interpretation panel installed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Details: Notwithstanding the plans hereby approved, details for the following (including 
existing and proposed scaled plans, elevations and sections to a scale of 1:10 or 
1:20 as appropriate) shall be provided to, and approved in writing by, the Local 
Planning Authority prior to the commencement of the relevant part of the work: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; 
a) Secondary glazing in relation to the existing windows and reveals. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; 
b) The proposed window G06.W02 to the frontage, to match window F08.W01. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
c) The proposed new door G07.W01 and step in front to the southern frontage to the 
proposed dirty utility room. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; 
d) Coal chute proposals, including clear and convincing justification for any heritage 
harm and photographic and textual recording of significance. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
e) Changes in access to front porch. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
f) Materials and details for the front conservatory addition. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
g) Photographic and textual recording of significance of the area to be altered to 
accommodate the lift. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
h) Clear and convincing justification if original floorboards are not proposed to be 
reused when the secondary staircase is re-sited. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
i) Proposed access control on ground and first floors. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
j) Proposed new doors to the north elevation of modern link. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
k) Retention of evidence of location of former historic doorway opening G08.D01. 
The works shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details and 
thereafter retained.&lt;/p&gt;
